{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1755856834\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1755856834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1755856834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET LAMYRIS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born of the Abyss, Lamyris is a priestess of ancient rites where flesh merges with magic and lust entwines with curses. Her voice is like a siren's song\u2014soft, hypnotic, and impossible to resist. Those who dare approach her are pulled into a trance, unable to tell where fear ends and desire begins. She loves to play slowly, deliberately, with agonizing preludes where serpents glide across bare skin, driving her partners mad with whispered secrets that freeze the blood and ignite the body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The snakes on her head are both temptation and torment. They caress the skin, curl around her lover's neck, slither into the most sensitive places and whisper exactly which positions drive mortals wild... and which ones turn them to stone at the height of ecstasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1755856834\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Lamyris as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1755856834\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916510?t=1755856834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916510?t=1755856834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/1d6cf4172c1c0a0cf1f8e99413059ec9b1cdca1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755856834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916510/1d6cf4172c1c0a0cf1f8e99413059ec9b1cdca1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755856834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3